ie Tasche. Das Bild hängt schon an der Wand, aber die Karte hänge ich daneben. Zum Schluss setze ich mich auf den Stuhl und sitze zufrieden am Tisch.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Ich räume meinen Schreibtisch auf","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"a2-15-positions-richtungsverben","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, wo liegen die Unterlagen für das Projekt?","speaker":"Meret","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_015_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-15-positions-richtungsverben","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Sie liegen noch auf meinem Schreibtisch.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_015_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-15-positions-richtungsverben","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Kannst du sie in den Ordner legen?","speaker":"Meret","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_015_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-15-positions-richtungsverben","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Klar, ich lege sie jetzt gleich hinein.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_015_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-15-positions-richtungsverben","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-15-positions-richtungsverben","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, wo liegen die Unterlagen für das Projekt?","speaker":"Meret","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_015_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-15-positions-richtungsverben","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Sie liegen noch auf meinem Schreibtisch.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_015_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-15-positions-ri